  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Don't Get Too Close (2 My Fantasy)**: back after 45 archived shows (671 days) [8]\n- **Mister Richard Smoker**: back after 36 archived shows (655 days) [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2005-07-16-mk4v-flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 93 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [1]\n- **ween2005-07-16-mk4v-flac24**: source not stated; 20 songs; 93 min [2]\n- **ween2005-07-16.prodigital**: source not stated; 20 songs; 92 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Show was free, held in New Hope; the reviewer learned of it that morning from a friend's phone call [7]\n- Fans climbed onto the canal bridge roof for a better view; about 15 people ended up there, and pizza was delivered [7]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2005-07-16-mk4v-flac16**: taped by pwk; transferred by pwk; source: schoeps mk4v > vms02ib > edirol r4 (24/96) [1]\n- **ween2005-07-16-mk4v-flac24**: taped by pwk; transferred by pwk; source: schoeps mk4v > vms02ib > edirol r4 (24/96) [2]. Also: A 24-bit/96 fileset of the recording, issued after a 16-bit/44 version was seeded to the public the evening of the show [2]",
